      "message": "```\nHi Diana, The FRS is working now. I removed the PLATFORM_EC_USBC_PPC_SYV682X_SMART_DISCHARGE.\n```\n\nIt aligns with my impression. So, I think the current driver can\u0027t not coherent FRS and smart discharge well.",
