      "writtenOn": "2023-01-12T07:46:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We don\u0027t know why FRS didn\u0027t work on board Rex with this config enabled.\nIn our test, the FRS worked fine. We upload LA logs here:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1OrTrWWPaHrIQWPMoQXfYgHzE5C2IHYx4/view?usp\u003dshare_link",
      "revId": "f6921223319a128917b949a2ab0ea172cb3702c7",
